I tried it yesterday with a test character and let me give you another
piece of advice: keep your pet out of the way. It killed "my" ghoul with
one bite, depriving me of the experience (it's a ghoul that is created,
not a zombie).

Also, a lot of people here will advise you *against* this. To start with,
I believe lawful characters get an alignment hit by writing on graves, and
secondly, it is advised against to let your experience level rise too fast
while you're not improving your equipment at the same rate. You'll get
more difficult monsters while you're lacking in equipment.

I would advise doing this once or twice (since it will triple your HP),
but no more. You'd get soldier ants chasing you around before you'd even
found an orcish helmet to protect you.

